    Prepare the Crosshaven v1 decoration without drawing it.
    
    The leaf frame, clearing, and sky swap in when their files exist. The rim props and corner plants stay in looks.json until props_live is set. Tiles, the light grade, and the live board stay as they are.
    
    Co-authored-by: maurogp12 <maurogp12@users.noreply.github.com>

